/**
 * @defgroup frontend Frontend
 * @{
 * @brief Frontend components of the ArgusAI system
 *
 * The frontend of ArgusAI is built using React and TypeScript, providing a modern
 * and responsive user interface for interacting with the AI system.
 *
 * @section frontend_components Components
 *
 * @subsection ui User Interface
 * The UI is organized into several key components:
 * - Main application layout
 * - Image/video upload interface
 * - Results visualization
 * - Settings and configuration panels
 *
 * @subsection features Key Features
 * The frontend provides:
 * - Real-time image and video processing
 * - Interactive visualization of detection results
 * - Model selection and configuration
 * - Multi-language support (English and Polish)
 *
 * @subsection tech_stack Technology Stack
 * The frontend is built using:
 * - React: UI framework
 * - TypeScript: Type-safe JavaScript
 * - Vite: Build tool and development server
 * - TailwindCSS: Styling framework
 *
 * @subsection structure Project Structure
 * The frontend codebase is organized as follows:
 * - src/: Source code directory
 *   - components/: React components
 *   - pages/: Page components
 *   - services/: API integration
 *   - utils/: Utility functions
 *   - types/: TypeScript type definitions
 *
 * @subsection api_integration API Integration
 * The frontend communicates with the backend through:
 * - REST API calls for image processing
 * - WebSocket connections for real-time updates
 * - File upload endpoints for media processing
 *
 * @see src/
 * @}
 */ 